{"id": "EUVD-2026-96571", "enisaUuid": "a9011634-d238-3ddd-841d-5e82e4f49b8b", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the SysDepartPermissionController queryById handler that allows any authenticated user to read department permission records. Low-privileged attackers can request GET /sys/sysDepartPermission/queryById with arbitrary ids to retrieve depart_id, permission_id and data_rule_ids for any department.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:26", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:03:17", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_depart_permission_query_by_id.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartPermissionController.java#L144-L149", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sysdepartpermission-querybyid-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m469-3qff-fv5x", "CVE-2026-108632"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a3577f9e-b9cd-3ad2-9265-178ab51a5343", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "09ac7344-f5dd-3ce7-954d-c76bb0ee9ba0", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}